        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">You were provisionally allocated <b>$12</b>. <br>The other participant was provisionally allocated <b>$0</b>.</span><br>\n&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">You have the option to make a transfer to the other participant. You can transfer any amount between $0 and $12.</span><br>\n&nbsp;</div>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">We ask you to describe a real-world situation you find similar to the task. The situation can involve two people or groups. It can be an experience you or somebody you know lived, or it could be fictional.<br>\n<br>\nThen, you may choose the amount of your transfer.</span>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>",
