    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_bBeKZ8gvO8uMoo6",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID183",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "The team leader After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<b>The team leader</b>\n<p>After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was awarded a performance bonus for exceeding their sales target. The recognition felt satisfying&mdash;a tangible reward for the long hours he&#39;d poured into work and the many nights he&#39;d stayed late fine-tuning his pitch. Steve&#39;s teammate Max had also played an important role, stepping in at a pivotal moment to offer a key tip that helped close the biggest deal.<br />\n<br />\nThe director called Steve to discuss the bonus and said: &quot;You guys did great. As you know, since you are the team leader, the usual split is for you to get 70% of the bonus and for Max to get 30%. However, the final decision is yours.&quot;<br />\n<br />\nNow Steve faced a choice. He could stick with the usual split, which already gave him most of the bonus. Or he could take from Max&rsquo;s 30%, arguing that his leadership and effort justified a bigger share. But he could also choose to give Max a larger portion, knowing that Max&#39;s contribution&mdash;though small&mdash;had come at a crucial moment. What should he do?</p>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q183",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "The team leader After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was...",
        "DisplayLogic": {
          "0": {
            "0": {
              "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">story</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to</span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 5 </span>",
              "LeftOperand": "story",
              "LogicType": "EmbeddedField",
              "Operator": "EqualTo",
              "RightOperand": "5",
              "Type": "Expression"
            },
            "Type": "If"
          },
          "Type": "BooleanExpression",
          "inPage": false
