    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_bBeKZ8gvO8uMoo6",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID186",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "A Windfall Decision Emma had always enjoyed playing the lottery, even though she never expected t...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>A Windfall Decision</strong><br />\nEmma had always enjoyed playing the lottery, even though she never expected to win. But one evening, after buying a ticket on a whim, she was stunned to see her numbers appear on the screen&mdash;she had won. It wasn&rsquo;t a life-changing sum, but it was a nice, unexpected bonus.&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>A few days later, as Emma was thinking about what to do with the money, she came across a crowdfunding campaign for a local community center that provided meals and after-school programs for kids from low-income families. The center was struggling to keep up with demand, and the organizers were trying to raise enough funds to stay open through the winter.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Emma knew she had complete control over her lottery winnings. No one expected her to share them, and no one would know if she chose to keep the entire amount. But she also knew that even a small donation could make a real difference to the community center. She could give away part of her winnings&mdash;or even all of them&mdash;but how much should she actually contribute?&nbsp;</p>\nClick to write the question text",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q186",
        "QuestionID": "QID186",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "A Windfall Decision Emma had always enjoyed playing the lottery, even though she never expected t...",
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "GradingData": [],
        "Language": [],
        "NextChoiceId": 4,
        "NextAnswerId": 1,
        "DisplayLogic": {
          "0": {
            "0": {
              "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">story</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to</span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 6 </span>",
              "LeftOperand": "story",
              "LogicType": "EmbeddedField",
              "Operator": "EqualTo",
              "RightOperand": "6",
              "Type": "Expression"
            },
            "Type": "If"
          },
          "Type": "BooleanExpression",
          "inPage": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_bBeKZ8gvO8uMoo6",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID187",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "The Mutual Aid Gift  James and his friend Mark had both been going through a rough financial patc..",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>The Mutual Aid Gift&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>James and his friend Mark had both been going through a rough financial patch. They often talked about ways to make ends meet, and neither of them had much savings left. One morning, James received an unexpected email from a local charity organization he had applied to months ago. &ldquo;Congratulations! You have been selected for financial assistance. You will be receiving the full aid amount to help with your expenses.&rdquo;&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Mark, who had applied for the same program, wasn&rsquo;t selected. Even though they were in similar situations, James was the only one who received the funds.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Now James faced a choice. The money was his, and there was no expectation to share. But he also knew Mark was struggling just as much. Should he give some of the money to Mark? And if so, how much?&nbsp;</p>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q187",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "The Mutual Aid Gift  James and his friend Mark had both been going through a rough financial patc...",
