    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_bBeKZ8gvO8uMoo6",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID195",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "The Team Leader After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<b>The Team Leader</b><p>After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was awarded a performance bonus for exceeding their sales target. The recognition felt satisfying—a tangible reward for the long hours he'd poured into work and the many nights he'd stayed late fine-tuning his pitch. Steve's teammate Max had also played an important role, stepping in at a pivotal moment to offer a key tip that helped close the biggest deal.<br>\n<br>\nThe director called Steve and said: \"You guys did great. Since you are the team leader, the usual split is for you to get 70% of the bonus and for Max to get 30%. However, the final decision is yours, and you may increase or decrease your share.\" Steve was thinking. Although he had the right to cut Max’s initial share, it did not seem fair given his input which if anything justified more than 30%. Also, Max knew about and already savored getting the bonus. He could not ignore these thoughts when choosing what to do.</p>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q195",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "The Team Leader After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was...",
        "DisplayLogic": {
          "0": {
            "0": {
              "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">story2</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to</span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 </span>",
