    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_bBeKZ8gvO8uMoo6",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID2",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Instructions In this task, you are matched with another Prolific participant. You will never know...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<strong>Instructions</strong><br>\n<br>\nIn this task, you are matched with another Prolific participant. You will never know the identity of the person with whom you are paired, and this person will never know your identity. One of you will be assigned to be <b>Player 1</b>, and the other will be assigned to be <b>Player 2</b>.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Player 1 will receive $6</b>, and Player 2 will receive $0. <b>Player 1</b> will decide<b> how much of the $6 to send</b> to Player 2. <b>Any amount sent will be multiplied by 3</b> before being received by Player 2.<br>\n<br>\nAfter receiving this amount, <b>Player 2</b> will decide <b>how much of it to send back to Player 1</b>. The amount sent back will not be changed.<br>\n<br>\nThe final allocation will be implemented for 1 participant out of 10. This means that your decision affect a bonus payment you and the other participant may receive.",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q2",
        "QuestionID": "QID2",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Instructions In this task, you are matched with another Prolific participant. You will never know...",
