    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_bBeKZ8gvO8uMoo6",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID204",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "The Mutual Aid Gift James and his friend Mark had both been going through a rough financial patch...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<p><strong>The Mutual Aid Gift</strong></p>\n\n<p>James and his friend Mark had both been going through a rough financial patch. They often talked about ways to make ends meet, and neither of them had much savings left. One morning, James received an unexpected email from a local charity organization he had applied to months ago. “Congratulations! You have been selected for financial assistance. You will be receiving the full aid amount to help with your expenses.”<br>\n<br>\nMark had applied for the same program, but received absolutely nothing. James got everything. The allocation, due only to luck, felt very unfair. Mark was struggling. At the same time, there was no expectation to share and James badly needed the money, so he was tempted to keep it all for himself. What should he do?</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q204",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "The Mutual Aid Gift James and his friend Mark had both been going through a rough financial patch...",
        "DisplayLogic": {
          "0": {
            "0": {
              "LogicType": "EmbeddedField",
              "LeftOperand": "story2",
              "Operator": "EqualTo",
              "RightOperand": "6",
              "Type": "Expression",
              "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">story2</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to</span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 6 </span>"
            },
            "Type": "If"
          },
          "Type": "BooleanExpression",
          "inPage": false
        },
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
        },
        "GradingData": [],
        "Language": [],
        "NextChoiceId": 4,
        "NextAnswerId": 1,
        "QuestionID": "QID204"
      }
    },
    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_bBeKZ8gvO8uMoo6",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID205",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "The Team Leader After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<b>The Team Leader</b>\n<p>After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was awarded a performance bonus for exceeding their sales target. The recognition felt satisfying—a tangible reward for the long hours he'd poured into work and the many nights he'd stayed late fine-tuning his pitch. The director called Steve to discuss the bonus and said: \"You guys did great. Since you are the team leader, the usual split is for you to get 70% of the bonus and for your teammate Max to get 30%. However, you may increase or decrease your share. The final decision is yours.\"&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Now Steve faced a choice. He could stick with the usual split, which already gave him most of the bonus. Or he could cut Max’s 30%, arguing that his leadership and effort justified a bigger share. But he could also choose to give Max a larger portion, knowing that Max made a significant contribution to the team’s success.&nbsp; What should he do?&nbsp;</p>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "Q205",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "The Team Leader After weeks of intense preparation, Steve was thrilled to learn that his team was...",
        "DisplayLogic": {
          "0": {
            "0": {
              "LogicType": "EmbeddedField",
              "LeftOperand": "story2",
              "Operator": "EqualTo",
              "RightOperand": "1",
              "Type": "Expression",
              "Description": "<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If</span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">story2</span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to</span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> 1 </span>"
            },
            "Type": "If"
          },
          "Type": "BooleanExpression",
          "inPage": false
