      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID235",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Imagine you sent $1 to Player 2, so he received $3. We now ask you: How much do you think Player...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Imagine you sent $1 to Player 2, so he received&nbsp;$3.<br><br> We now ask you: How much do you think Player 2 would send back to you?</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n  <br></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<table style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <table id=\"${e://Field/color_1}\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>\n                <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" step=\"0.5\" min=\"0\" max=\"3\" list=\"tickmarks\" id=\"beliefSlider\" class=\"slider\">\n                <div>\n                  <center>\n                    <b>Expected amount sent back ($0 to $3): <span id=\"beliefOutput\"> Click on the slider </span></b>\n                  </center>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n      <td>&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
        "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n\n\n  // Configure slider bounds dynamically\n  var slider = document.getElementById(\"beliefSlider\");\n  slider.value = 0;\n\n  // If you want integer dollars only, change step to 1\n  slider.step = 0.5;\n\n  /* Belief Slider */\n  slider.oninput = function() {\n    writeBeliefValue();\n    storeBeliefValue();\n    jQuery(\"#NextButton\").show();\n  };\n\n  function writeBeliefValue() {\n    slider.className = \"slider_click\";\n    var val = parseFloat(slider.value);\n    // Format nicely: no trailing .0 if integer\n    var shown = (Math.round(val) === val) ? val.toFixed(0) : val.toFixed(1);\n    document.getElementById(\"beliefOutput\").innerHTML = \"$\" + shown;\n  }\n\n  function storeBeliefValue() {\n    var val = slider.value;\n    Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData(\"beliefs\", val);\n  }\n\n});",
