        "QuestionText": "<center> Please, set as many sliders as you can at 50.</center><center><br></center><center><br></center>\n\n<div class=\"slider-container\">\n<div><span id=\"value1\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider1\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value2\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider2\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value3\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider3\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value4\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider4\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value5\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider5\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value6\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider6\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value7\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider7\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value8\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider8\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value9\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider9\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value10\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider10\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value11\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slider11\" class=\"slider\"></div>\n\n<div><span id=\"value12\" class=\"slider-value\">0</span> <input value=\"0\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" id=\"slid